    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Siege Regiment",
    "summary": "Pick one support option as the round opens. All three have the same target quota: 2 for Incursion, 3 for Strike Force and 4 for Onslaught. The effects expire with the round.\nCreeping Barrage — Test enemy units one by one with a D6, stopping at the quota. Eligible enemies are over 12 inches from every friendly model on the board. A 5+ cuts that unit’s Move by 2 inches and its charge rolls by 2.\nIncendiary Bombardment — Use the same enemy range restriction. Select units directly to strip their Cover.\nSmoke Shells — Give Stealth to the friendly units you pick.",
